name: Experimental dependency candidates disclose coverage and preserve Map readiness
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dependency_candidates.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: logs
submit: run threat-intel:discover
require-live-snap: 30 Coverage is incomplete | partial-candidates
expect: sbom-scan:scan
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dependency_candidates.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
submit: replay latest
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · partial | replay-loaded
keys: Escape
live-snap: partial-replay
expect: Outcome · partial
resize: 160x48
live-snap: candidates-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: candidates-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: candidates-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: candidates-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: candidates-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: candidates-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: candidates-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: candidates-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: candidates-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: candidates-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: candidates-page-6-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dependency_candidates.py @TMP_TARGET @ART pages
ask: Is the partial outcome clear, with the complete coverage warning and inventory action reachable through paging at every size?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
submit: run threat-intel:list
require-live-snap: 25 threat-intel:list loaded 1 entry | catalog-read
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: run sbom-scan:scan
require-live-snap: 30 sbom-scan: 2 components | full-fixture-inventory
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 no map artifacts yet | restarted-without-map
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 LOGS | recovered-history
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · partial | recovered-partial-receipt
expect: Coverage is incomplete
expect: sbom-scan:scan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dependency_candidates.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart preserve the receipts while leaving Map unaccepted, with no findings, requests or source changes?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
